:" to send,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and read them back into records on a server."}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/collectorencoding","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding"},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/WhatGoesWhere":{"title":"Logging, Tracing, Metrics and Analytics","kind":"article","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Four signals, four jobs. Decide which one a fact belongs to before you write the line that records it.","type":"text"}],"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/whatgoeswhere","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/WhatGoesWhere"},"doc://PostHogEncoding/documentation/PostHogEncoding":{"url":"\/documentation\/posthogencoding","identifier":"doc:\/\/PostHogEncoding\/documentation\/PostHogEncoding","title":"PostHogEncoding","abstract":[{"text":"Send records to PostHog Cloud or a self-hosted PostHog through its batch capture API.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/ChoosingDestinations":{"url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/ChoosingDestinations","title":"Choosing Destinations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Deliver events to your logs, your traces, a server or memory, and decide what each destination may see."}],"role":"article","kind":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://MatomoEncoding/documentation/MatomoEncoding":{"title":"MatomoEncoding","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Send records to a Matomo installation as events, through its bulk tracking API.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/matomoencoding","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"url":"\/documentation\/destinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","title":"Destinations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where tracked events go: the "},{"code":"Destination","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the modifiers that narrow what a destination receives, and the delivery that hands it batches."}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}